1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:03,800
ScriptVox turns your own clips into a
narrated video.

2
00:00:03,800 --> 00:00:08,088
It writes captions that fit the screen,
in English and in Arabic.

3
00:00:08,088 --> 00:00:10,375
Every render can resume after
a crash.
